  "description": "The SAML IdP profile titled **\u201cExampleCorp SAML IdP Profile\u201d** is configured to issue assertions to the service provider at **https://sp.example.com/** using the service\u2011provider identifier **https://sp.example.com/** and the assertion consumer service URL **https://sp.example.com/SAML2/ACS**.  The IdP\u2019s issuer name is **https://idp.example.com/**, signed with the certificate file **idp_cert.pem** (signing certificate version **v3**) and the service\u2011provider certificate is **sp_cert.pem** (version **v3**).  Assertions are signed both on the response and on the assertion itself (**signassertion = BOTH**) with the signature algorithm **RSA\u2011SHA256**, and the signature service endpoint is **https://idp.example.com/sign**.  The digest method employed is **SHA256**.  Encryption of assertions is enabled (**encryptassertion = ON**) using the algorithm **AES256** and the key\u2011transport algorithm **RSA_OAEP**.  Communication with the SP uses the POST SAML binding for both authentication requests (**samlbinding = POST**) and logout (**logoutbinding = POST**), with the single logout URL set to **https://sp.example.com/logout**.  The IdP accepts audience **https://sp.example.com/**, and the NameID is generated from the expression **${user.email}** in the **emailAddress** format.  Metadata is retrieved from **https://idp.example.com/metadata.xml**, refreshes every **1440** minutes, and its import status is **SUCCESS**.  The default authentication group for users is **SAMLUsers**, unsigned requests are not rejected (**rejectunsignedrequests = OFF**), and passwords are not sent (**sendpassword = OFF**).  Clock skew tolerance is set to **300** seconds.\n\nUser attributes released to the SP are mapped as follows: **uid** (friendly name \u201cUser ID\u201d, expression **${user.uid}**, format **Basic**); **mail** (\u201cEmail Address\u201d, **${user.mail}**, **Basic**); **givenName** (\u201cFirst Name\u201d, **${user.firstName}**, **Basic**); **sn** (\u201cLast Name\u201d, **${user.lastName}**, **Basic**); **department** (\u201cDepartment\u201d, **${user.department}**, **Basic**); **title** (\u201cJob Title\u201d, **${user.title}**, **Basic**); **telephoneNumber** (\u201cPhone Number\u201d, **${user.phone}**, **Basic**); **memberOf** (\u201cGroups\u201d, **${user.groups}**, **Basic**); **employeeNumber** (\u201cEmployee Number\u201d, **${user.employeeNumber}**, **Basic**); **preferredLanguage** (\u201cPreferred Language\u201d, **${user.language}**, **Basic**); **locale** (\u201cLocale\u201d, **${user.locale}**, **Basic**); **postalCode** (\u201cPostal Code\u201d, **${user.postalCode}**, **Basic**); **streetAddress** (\u201cStreet Address\u201d, **${user.street}**, **Basic**); **city** (\u201cCity\u201d, **${user.city}**, **Basic**); **state** (\u201cState/Province\u201d, **${user.state}**, **Basic**); and **country** (\u201cCountry\u201d, **${user.country}**, **Basic**)."
